    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351453d7a1734f177fedf07f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "换句话说就是“将来要赢得GⅠ这件事”。在身体还没\n准备好的阶段就要配合2400米做调整，风险太高了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f30143b9764777ad7daf49e34ec0fa44dc6abd77788871267db961efd5ee1e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
