    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2570d1ad43ed47f69714de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以之后的新马级作为考量，GⅠ的最长距离是2000米。\n身为训练员，我无法做出让你专注于测试而将其舍弃的判断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c823d8ad60ae4175f4596db02b519838e5614ce6a74ab5aa9bbbe39e82a17aa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
